# ---------- Prepare ----------
prepare/output/
prepare/config.yml

# ---------- Copilot Instructions ----------
backend/.github/copilot-instructions.md
frontend/.github/copilot-instructions.md

# ---------- Test Artifacts ----------
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/test-results/
MDs/
